component par_two_reads
conflict m readA read readB read
banks m 2
assign m readA read 0
assign m readB read 1
component par_three_reads
conflict m readA read readB read
conflict m readA read readC read
conflict m readB read readC read
banks m 3
assign m readA read 0
assign m readB read 1
assign m readC read 2
component par_read_write
conflict m rd read wr write
banks m 2
assign m rd read 0
assign m wr write 1
component nested_par
conflict m a read b read
conflict m a read c read
conflict m b read c read
banks m 3
assign m a read 0
assign m b read 1
assign m c read 2
component two_mems
banks m 1
banks n 1
assign m ra read 0
assign n rb read 0
component par_seq_mem
conflict m readA read writeB write
banks m 2
assign m readA read 0
assign m writeB write 1
component par_static_groups
conflict m sa read sb read
banks m 2
assign m sa read 0
assign m sb read 1
component par_static_islands
conflict m sa read sb read
banks m 2
assign m sa read 0
assign m sb read 1
component main
